"usage: firefly-reports report [-h] [--url URL] [--token TOKEN] [--lang {en,it}] [--debug] [--debug-file PATH] [--trust-insecure-ssl] [--start YYYY-MM-DD] [--end YYYY-MM-DD] [--year YYYY] [--owner OWNER] [--currency CURRENCY] [--out DIR] [--years {3,5}] [--legacy-report | --no-legacy-report] [--tags TAG1,TAG2] [--fetch-links | --no-fetch-links] [--link-delay SEC] [--all-tags | --no-all-tags] [--no-pdf] [--no-excel] [--accounts-include ID1,ID2] [--accounts-exclude ID1,ID2] [--categories-include C1,C2] [--categories-exclude C1,C2] [--hide-transfers] [--show-transfers] [--reconciled-only | --no-reconciled-only] [--fiscal-year-start MM-DD] Generate the PDF + Excel financial reports from a Firefly III instance. options: -h, --help show this help message and exit --url URL Firefly III base URL --token TOKEN Personal Access Token --lang {en,it} Language of the output --debug Enable debug log to file --debug-file PATH Log file path --trust-insecure-ssl Do not verify TLS certificates at all (self-signed, expired, blocklisted CA); your token can be intercepted. Command line only --start YYYY-MM-DD Start date (YYYY-MM-DD) --end YYYY-MM-DD End date (YYYY-MM-DD) --year YYYY Full calendar year mode (unlocks year-only reports: YoY, historical, liquidity forecast). Mutually exclusive with --start/--end --owner OWNER Account owner name (report header) --currency CURRENCY Currency symbol (default: €) --out DIR Output directory (default: ./output) --years {3,5} Number of years for historical analysis (default: 3) --legacy-report, --no-legacy-report Use legacy PDF report styles (--no-legacy-report overrides the config file) --tags TAG1,TAG2 Tags for the tagged transaction report --fetch-links, --no-fetch-links Fetch full details for linked transactions (slower) --link-delay SEC Seconds between requests when fetching linked transactions (default: 0.2) --all-tags, --no-all-tags Generate a comprehensive report for all tags --no-pdf Skip PDF generation --no-excel Skip Excel generation --accounts-include ID1,ID2 Only these asset account IDs --accounts-exclude ID1,ID2 Exclude these asset account IDs --categories-include C1,C2 Only these categories --categories-exclude C1,C2 Exclude these categories --hide-transfers Drop transfer transactions from all reports --show-transfers Keep transfer transactions (overrides show_transfers = false in the config file) --reconciled-only, --no-reconciled-only Only reconciled transactions --fiscal-year-start MM-DD Fiscal year start (year mode only, default: 01-01) examples: firefly-reports report --year 2025 --owner \"Jane Doe\" firefly-reports report --start 2025-01-01 --end 2025-06-30 --no-excel"
